  "summary": "Remove package work from routine compiler research gates.",
  "why": "Exact dependency locks remain. Normal local and pull-request CI now stop at behavior, governance, domain examples, and documentation; distribution construction moves to the explicit package profile and release workflow. R02 completion is rebound to behavior, exact evidence, privacy, and unselected state, while the full distribution audit remains planned at CC-PKG02."
